{"sha": "12737c5d7bc1676bfdf535fd110bf041930d4d58b251e1cf36ec080e0a2e215d", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:space} 章 --- 空间中的向量、直线与平面}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:1}", "$\\vect{AB}(2, 1, -1)$ 与 $\\vect{AC}(1, -1, 1)$ 不成比例", "（$\\frac21 \\neq \\frac{1}{-1}$），故三点不共线。直线 $(AB)$ 的方程为：", "\\[", "(x, y, z) = (1 + 2t,\\; t,\\; 2 - t), \\qquad t \\in \\R .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:2}", "$2(x - 1) - (y - 1) + 3(z - 0) = 0$，\\emph{即}", "\\[", "2x - y + 3z - 1 = 0 .", "\\]", "对 $B(0,2,1)$，$0 - 2 + 3 - 1 = 0$，成立，故 $B$ 在该平面上。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:3}", "$\\vect{AB}(1,1,0)$，$\\vect{AC}(1,0,1)$：", "\\[", "\\cos\\widehat{A}", "= \\frac{\\vect{AB}\\cdot\\vect{AC}}{\\norm{\\vect{AB}}\\,\\norm{\\vect{AC}}}", "= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2\\,\\sqrt2} = \\frac12,", "\\]", "于是 $\\widehat A = 60^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:4}", "直线 $\\mathcal D$ 上的点为 $(1 + t,\\, 2 - t,\\, 2t)$。将其代入", "$\\mathcal P$ 的方程，得：", "\\[", "2(1+t) + (2 - t) - 2t + 1 = 5 - t = 0 \\iff t = 5 .", "\\]", "唯一交点为 $(6, -3, 10)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:5}", "两平面的法向量 $(1, -1, 2)$ 与 $(2, 1, 1)$ 不共线，故两", "平面相交于一条直线。两式相加得 $3x + 3z = 5$，于是", "$x = \\frac53 - z$；再由第一式得", "$y = x + 2z - 1 = \\frac23 + z$。记 $z = t$：", "\\[", "(x, y, z) = \\left(\\frac53 - t,\\; \\frac23 + t,\\; t\\right), \\qquad t \\in \\R,", "\\]", "所得为方向向量为 $(-1, 1, 1)$ 的直线。（两方程代入后", "恒成立。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:6}", "两直线的方向向量 $\\vec u_1(1, 2, -1)$ 与 $\\vec u_2(1, 1, 2)$ 不共线，", "故两直线不平行。若二者相交，则需", "\\[", "1 + t = 2 + s, \\qquad 2t = 1 + s, \\qquad 3 - t = 1 + 2s .", "\\]", "由前两式得 $t = 1 + s$ 及 $2(1+s) = 1 + s$，于是 $s = -1$，$t = 0$；", "代入第三式得 $3 = -1$，矛盾。故两直线无公共点，且不平行，", "两直线为异面直线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:7}", "\\emph{1.} 距离 $\\operatorname{dist} = \\dfrac{\\abs{2\\cdot3 - 1 + 2\\cdot1 - 3}}", "{\\sqrt{4 + 1 + 4}} = \\dfrac{4}{3}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 设 $H = M_0 + t\\,\\vec n$，其中 $\\vec n(2, -1, 2)$，选取 $t$", "使 $H \\in \\mathcal P$：", "\\[", "2(3 + 2t) - (1 - t) + 2(1 + 2t) - 3 = 4 + 9t = 0 \\iff t = -\\frac49 .", "\\]", "故 $H\\left(\\frac{19}{9}, \\frac{13}{9}, \\frac19\\right)$，且", "\\[", "M_0H = \\norm{t\\,\\vec n} = \\frac49 \\times 3 = \\frac43,", "\\]", "与距离公式的结果一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:8}", "坐标：$G(1,1,1)$，平面 $(BDE)$ 经过点 $B(1,0,0)$，", "$D(0,1,0)$，$E(0,0,1)$。", "", "\\emph{1.} 平面 $(BDE)$ 的方程为 $x + y + z = 1$（三点满足该方程，", "且三点不共线），因此 $\\vec n(1,1,1)$ 为该平面的", "法向量。由 $\\vect{AG} = (1,1,1) = \\vec n$ 知，对角线 $(AG)$ 与", "平面 $(BDE)$ 正交。", "", "\\emph{2.} 点 $A(0,0,0)$ 到平面的距离：", "$\\frac{\\abs{0 + 0 + 0 - 1}}{\\sqrt3} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt3} = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}$.", "直线 $(AG)$ 为 $(t, t, t)$；当 $3t = 1$ 时与平面相交，", "交点为 $\\left(\\frac13, \\frac13, \\frac13\\right)$，它是", "三角形 $BDE$ 的重心。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:space:9}", "\\emph{1.} $\\vect{AB}(1, 0, -1)$，$\\vect{AC}(-1, 1, 0)$，", "$\\vect{AD}(1, 1, 1)$。若 $\\vect{AD} = a\\vect{AB} + b\\vect{AC}$，则", "由坐标得 $a - b = 1$，$b = 1$，$-a = 1$，前两式推出", "$a = 2$，与 $a = -1$ 矛盾。四点不共面。", "", "\\emph{2.} $\\vect{BC}(-2, 1, 1)$，$\\vect{BD}(0, 1, 2)$。求解", "$\\vec n \\cdot \\vect{BC} = \\vec n \\cdot \\vect{BD} = 0$，由", "$b + 2c = 0$ 得 $b = -2c$；再由 $-2a - 2c + c = 0$ 得 $c = -2a$。取", "$a = 1$，得 $\\vec n(1, 4, -2)$。过点 $B(2,1,0)$ 的平面为：", "\\[", "x + 4y - 2z - 6 = 0 .", "\\]", "", "\\emph{3.} 点 $A(1,1,1)$ 到平面的距离：", "$\\dfrac{\\abs{1 + 4 - 2 - 6}}{\\sqrt{21}} = \\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt{21}}$.", "三角形 $BCD$ 的面积：$\\norm{\\vect{BC}}^2 = 6$，$\\norm{\\vect{BD}}^2 = 5$，", "$\\vect{BC}\\cdot\\vect{BD} = 3$，于是", "\\[", "\\text{面积} = \\frac12\\sqrt{6 \\times 5 - 9} = \\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{2}.", "\\]", ""]}